{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕追着要回应会搅坏眼前的亲近，对方也没答应过他什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"眼前的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他把心思转去替对方高兴，告诉自己，真心盼对方好，自己也会开心。\",\n      \"key\": \"替对方高兴\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他暂时没那么担心自己在对方心里是否特别，也不计较给了多少、不怕显得更在乎，觉得还有许多心意可给。\",\n      \"key\": \"许多心意可给\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他放开些去喜欢，反倒更舍不得这一刻过去，热切起来又怕成了催促，只好收住一点。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得这一刻\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他甚至把这阵轻松当成保证，以为只要不向对方要回应，就能尽情喜欢，也不会失去眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不会失去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想保护已经得到的亲近、不愿把喜欢变成催促的动机，说明他为何选择先调整自己，而不是向对方索取回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把注意力转向关心和给予的自我安抚，改成他当下会对自己说的话；这次调整确实能让他暂时轻松下来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\", \"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并澄清\",\n      \"why\": \"合并轻松后更愿意付出、不再计较多少和不怕显得更在乎，保留他觉得自己还有许多心意可给的满足感。明确暂时退去的是担心自己在对方心里是否特别的紧张。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足\",\n      \"why\": \"补出确认焦虑暂退后仍在、甚至更强的舍不得：他越放开去喜欢，越不愿眼前的亲近过去，热切时又怕成了催促而收住一点。由此解释B2的打开与退弱、B3的想抓紧，以及B4尚未失去便已舍不得的酸楚。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把暂时轻松误当成不会失去的保证，明确这是他当时的过度确信，而非故事认可的道理，为下一段仍想被看见、继而难堪留下直接前提。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "326cbbb6-3470-4bdd-9da2-fb621b57dab5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223529659233Z", "elapsed_seconds": 414.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:42:24.552551+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9837ed349f48d8d88412d5ad31555248711c2a96281286b3fb29428ca5052c9a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}